Grants and kill switch
Core's level: Permissive · Kill switch: off

Turn the kill switch on?
Everything "Revoke all" ends, and it stops what is running now, in every pane, Claude
panes included: a reply in progress is cancelled and the commands it is running are ended,
and so are background terminals.
Until you turn it off here: Corbanu sends nothing to the model (each new turn is
refused with a message saying so), messages from other agents wait and are delivered
with the first turn after you turn it off, no grant can be issued, protected actions
after untrusted content are refused, the browser and memory writes are refused, and the
credential broker stays closed.
Saved in security_state.json: it holds after a restart. The level stays Permissive.

enter confirm · esc cancel, nothing changes
